  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Myanmar Green Economy Forum 2012 - Myanmar Green Economy Forum</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Myanmar Green Economy Forum 2012</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Green Economy and Green growth is an important issue if you want to achieve sustainable development in Southeast Asia. The conference GEGG, held in Myanmar the 12-16 of November 2012, will address these issues and is also strategically put since Myanmar is becoming a more important actor to involve. Participants will come from the whole South East Asian region.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Gr&#xF6;n ekonomi och gr&#xF6;n utveckling &#xE4;r viktiga aspekter f&#xF6;r att uppn&#xE5; h&#xE5;llbar utveckling, inte minst i Sydostasien som kommer drabbas h&#xE5;rt av klimatf&#xF6;r&#xE4;ndringar. Konferensen GEGG, h&#xE5;lls i Myanmar den 12-16 november 2012, avser att adressera detta och &#xE4;r strategiskt placerad d&#xE5; Myanmar blir en allt viktigare akt&#xF6;r att inkludera. Konferensen f&#xF6;rv&#xE4;ntas stort deltagande fr&#xE5;n hela den sydostasiatiska regionen.</narrative>
  </description>
